              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 27,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "IP address - used at transport level for regional routing, abuse prevention, and CDN optimization"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 29,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 29,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "By default, this data is anonymous to the app user. Capgo does not receive names, emails, account IDs, medical record numbers, credentials, user content, app analytics events, or behavioral analytics from the updater. The only stable identifier is the random, app-scoped "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 29,
            "column": 272
          },
          "text": "device_id"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 29,
            "column": 283
          },
          "text": ", which is not an advertising ID and is not tied to a known user unless you set "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 29,
            "column": 363
          },
          "text": "custom_id"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 29,
            "column": 374
          },
          "text": " yourself."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 31,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 31,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "If your HIPAA review requires no hosted update statistics at all, set "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 31,
            "column": 71
          },
          "text": "statsUrl"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 31,
            "column": 81
          },
          "text": " to an empty string. That fully disables updater statistics reporting to Capgo Cloud while update checks can still use "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 31,
            "column": 200
          },
          "text": "updateUrl"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 31,
            "column": 211
          },
          "text": " and "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 31,
            "column": 216
          },
          "text": "channelUrl"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 31,
            "column": 228
          },
          "text": " if you leave them enabled."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 33,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 33,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Do not set a custom ID"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 35,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 35,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "For HIPAA-sensitive deployments, do not call "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 35,
            "column": 46
          },
          "text": "CapacitorUpdater.setCustomId(...)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 35,
            "column": 81
          },
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 37,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 37,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "The custom ID is included in updater statistics when it is configured. If you set it to an email address, user ID, patient ID, employee ID, account ID, or any other value that maps back to a person, you have tied the updater telemetry to personal data in your own app context."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 39,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 39,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "If your review requires hosted Capgo telemetry to stay device-scoped, leave "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 39,
            "column": 77
          },
          "text": "custom_id"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 39,
            "column": 88
          },
          "text": " unset."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 41,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 41,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Option 1: Geo-localize Capgo Cloud plugin traffic"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 43,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 43,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "If your review allows Capgo Cloud but requires EU data residency for plugin data, configure all three updater endpoints to the EU host:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 45,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "typescript",
      "meta": "title=\"capacitor.config.ts\"",
      "text": "import type { CapacitorConfig } from '@capacitor/cli';\n\nconst config: CapacitorConfig = {\n  appId: 'com.example.app',\n  appName: 'My App',\n  webDir: 'dist',\n  plugins: {\n    CapacitorUpdater: {\n      autoUpdate: 'atBackground',\n      updateUrl: 'https://plugin.eu.capgo.app/updates',\n      statsUrl: 'https://plugin.eu.capgo.app/stats',\n      channelUrl: 'https://plugin.eu.capgo.app/channel_self',\n    },\n  },\n};\n\nexport default config;"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 65,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 65,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Use the EU URLs together. Mixing "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 65,
            "column": 34
          },
          "text": "plugin.capgo.app"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 65,
            "column": 52
          },
          "text": " and "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 65,
            "column": 57
          },
          "text": "plugin.eu.capgo.app"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 65,
            "column": 78
          },
          "text": " can route part of the plugin data path outside the EU host."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 67,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 67,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "This keeps Capgo's hosted update monitoring, statistics, alerts, and troubleshooting data available while placing the plugin data path in Europe."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "component",
      "name": "LinkCard",
      "props": {
        "title": "Data Location",
        "href": "/docs/live-updates/data-location/"
      },
      "blocks": [],
      "location": {
        "line": 69,
        "column": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 71,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 71,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Option 2: Disable the statistics endpoint"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 73,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 73,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "If your review does not allow statistics to be sent to Capgo Cloud, set "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 73,
            "column": 73
          },
          "text": "statsUrl"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 73,
            "column": 83
          },
          "text": " to an empty string:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 75,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "typescript",
      "meta": "title=\"capacitor.config.ts\"",
      "text": "import type { CapacitorConfig } from '@capacitor/cli';\n\nconst config: CapacitorConfig = {\n  appId: 'com.example.app',\n  appName: 'My App',\n  webDir: 'dist',\n  plugins: {\n    CapacitorUpdater: {\n      autoUpdate: 'atBackground',\n      statsUrl: '',\n    },\n  },\n};\n\nexport default config;"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 93,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 93,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "This disables statistics reporting from the updater plugin. Update checks and downloads can still use Capgo Cloud if you keep the default "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 93,
            "column": 139
          },
          "text": "updateUrl"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 93,
            "column": 150
          },
          "text": " and "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 93,
            "column": 155
          },
          "text": "channelUrl"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 93,
            "column": 167
          },
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 95,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 95,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "After changing "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 95,
            "column": 16
          },
          "text": "capacitor.config.ts"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 95,
            "column": 37
          },
          "text": ", sync the native projects and ship a new store build. Existing installs will keep using their previous native config until they receive that new binary."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 97,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 97,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "What you lose when statistics are disabled"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 99,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 99,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Disabling "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 99,
            "column": 11
          },
          "text": "statsUrl"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 99,
            "column": 21
          },
          "text": " removes the hosted signal Capgo uses to explain what happened inside your app after an update was offered or downloaded."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 101,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 101,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "You lose:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "location": {
        "line": 103,
        "column": 1
      },
      "ordered": false,
      "start": null,
      "spread": false,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 103,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 103,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 103,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "Dashboard visibility into successful installs, failed installs, download failures, rollbacks, and app-ready events"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 104,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 104,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 104,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "Failure alerts that depend on hosted statistics"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 105,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 105,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 105,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "The ability to quickly tell which app versions, OS versions, platforms, or plugin versions are affected by an update issue"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 106,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 106,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 106,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "Device-level troubleshooting trails in Capgo Cloud"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 107,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 107,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 107,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "Aggregate update adoption and app usage statistics in the Capgo dashboard"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 108,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 108,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 108,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "Better support context from the Capgo team, because the hosted service no longer receives the events that explain the device-side update path"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 110,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 110,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Automatic update delivery can still work, but you are operating with reduced observability. Plan your own monitoring before disabling statistics in production."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 112,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 112,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Option 3: Self-host the statistics endpoint"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 114,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 114,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "If your review allows update checks through Capgo Cloud but requires statistics to remain inside your infrastructure, point "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 114,
            "column": 125
          },
          "text": "statsUrl"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 114,
            "column": 135
          },
          "text": " to your own endpoint:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 116,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "typescript",
      "meta": "title=\"capacitor.config.ts\"",
      "text": "import type { CapacitorConfig } from '@capacitor/cli';\n\nconst config: CapacitorConfig = {\n  appId: 'com.example.app',\n  appName: 'My App',\n  webDir: 'dist',\n  plugins: {\n    CapacitorUpdater: {\n      autoUpdate: 'atBackground',\n      statsUrl: 'https://updates.example.com/capgo/stats',\n    },\n  },\n};\n\nexport default config;"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 134,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 134,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Your endpoint should accept the updater statistics payload and return:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 136,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "json",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "{ \"status\": \"ok\" }"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 140,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 140,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Use this path when you want to keep internal alerting, audit logs, and incident analysis without sending device update statistics to Capgo Cloud."
        }
      ]
    },
