      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 144,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Option 4: Licensed self-hosting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 146,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 146,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "If Capgo Cloud, EU data residency, disabled statistics, or a self-hosted statistics endpoint still does not satisfy your HIPAA review, Capgo can help you move to a licensed self-hosted deployment."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 148,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 148,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "This is the strictest option because your organization controls the updater backend, statistics endpoint, logs, retention, infrastructure, and network boundary. It also means you must own more of the operational work that Capgo Cloud normally handles for you."
        }
      ]
    },
