            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Capgo works with companies going through HIPAA compliance review, including companies in the U.S. that use Capgo in HIPAA-compliant programs. Contact Capgo if your reviewer needs a deployment model, data flow, or licensing path that is stricter than the hosted defaults."
